{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Rustbucket to Megaship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small freighter and work your way up to colossal trade vessels, each fully customizable with crew, modules, and systems. Prepare for long-range jumps, avoid pirates, and survive hostile space anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/ea5d5a61655ee81a925fb299bc6cb39d.poster.avif?t=1761214625\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/ea5d5a61655ee81a925fb299bc6cb39d.webm?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/ea5d5a61655ee81a925fb299bc6cb39d.mp4?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Merchant of the Galaxy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy low, sell high, and negotiate under pressure. Master planetary economies, discover black market opportunities, exploit regional shortages, or stabilize entire systems through strategic logistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/900371452854dfc0b479452e5382c6e3.poster.avif?t=1761214625\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/900371452854dfc0b479452e5382c6e3.webm?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/900371452854dfc0b479452e5382c6e3.mp4?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Stations and Colonies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim orbital space above uncolonized planets. Construct your own space station, manage supply chains, and guide the development of worlds as you expand your influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/e21fddb0aca547d86a18ca91204e8bae.poster.avif?t=1761214625\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/e21fddb0aca547d86a18ca91204e8bae.webm?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/e21fddb0aca547d86a18ca91204e8bae.mp4?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lord of War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't start wars, but you know how to steer them. Navigate between rival powers, form alliances when needed, and pull strings behind the scenes. Your wealth and influence let you shift supply lines, tip political balances, and quietly reshape the future of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/782de178b6ec85119f60332684450b29.poster.avif?t=1761214625\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/782de178b6ec85119f60332684450b29.webm?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/782de178b6ec85119f60332684450b29.mp4?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slice of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unforgettable characters, explore ancient ruins, solve strange puzzles, and experience personal storylines that include romance, mystery, and moments of humor. The galaxy holds more than just cargo and credits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/fc5f846cd1d5c16d7e8b6d6cdcdf8906.poster.avif?t=1761214625\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/fc5f846cd1d5c16d7e8b6d6cdcdf8906.webm?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/extras/fc5f846cd1d5c16d7e8b6d6cdcdf8906.mp4?t=1761214625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867570?t=1761214625","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/314950c103d1cc157089a43156e1c611b47c75e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761214625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/f9b23db6c47e3549bf8e03568c8e715c9c1181b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761214625","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867570/f9b23db6c47e3549bf8e03568c8e715c9c1181b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761214625","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Rustbucket to Megaship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small freighter and work your way up to colossal trade vessels, each fully customizable with crew, modules, and systems. Prepare for long-range jumps, avoid pirates, and survive hostile space anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pla